The first pattern is voice embedded in applications.

39
00:02:11,730 --> 00:02:15,759
想象一个游戏或生产力工具，用户可以使用语音命令，
Think of a game or a productivity tool where users can use voice commands,

40
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:18,930
但也可以直接点击并与 UI 交互。
but they can also click and interact with the UI directly.

41
00:02:19,570 --> 00:02:22,728
语音智能体需要在用户说话时触发 UI 变化，
The voice agent needs to trigger UI changes when the user speaks

42
00:02:22,728 --> 00:02:25,410
也需要知道用户何时点击了某个内容。
and it needs to know when the user clicks on something.

43
00:02:26,090 --> 00:02:30,330
这种双向感知正是让体验显得自然的原因。
That bidirectional awareness is what makes the experience feel natural.

44
00:02:31,450 --> 00:02:34,729
第二种模式是为现有智能体添加语音，
The second pattern is voice for existing agents,

45
00:02:34,729 --> 00:02:39,960
你已经构建了 Claude、GPT 或 LangChain 驱动的智能体，并带有自定义逻辑。
you've already built a Claude, GPT, or LangChain-powered agent with custom logic.

46
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,640
你不想重写它。
You don't want to rewrite it.

47
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:45,000
Vocal Bridge 作为一个轻量层，位于你的智能体前面。
Vocal Bridge sits as a thin layer in front of your agent.

48
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,571
它负责语音到意图的转换，
It handles voice-to-intent conversion,

49
00:02:47,571 --> 00:02:51,549
并判断何时把问题委派给智能体，何时自行处理
by understanding when to delegate a question to your agent versus handling

50
00:02:51,549 --> 00:02:53,600
寒暄。
conversational pleasantries itself.

51
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:59,010
第三种模式是将语音作为你的 LLM 可以调用的工具。
The third pattern is voice as a tool your LLM can call.

52
00:02:59,490 --> 00:03:02,655
想象一个负责协调面试的招聘智能体，
Imagine a recruiting agent coordinating interviews,

53
00:03:02,655 --> 00:03:06,714
候选人发来可面试时间，智能体用文字回复确认
candidate texts availability and the agent responds in text to confirm

54
00:03:06,714 --> 00:03:09,879
然后还会打电话并协调面试日期
and then also calls and coordinates the interview date

55
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:14,970
选择最适合候选人的日期；或者一个通过聊天与你协作的头脑风暴智能体。
that works best for the candidate or a brainstorming agent working with you via chat.

56
00:03:15,890 --> 00:03:20,210
它会说“这个用语音聊会更快”，然后打开一个实时语音会话。
It says, "this would be faster to talk through" and opens a live voice session.

57
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:22,940
这样，智能体就选择了合适的交互方式。
So the agent chooses the right modality.

