并从多个 TTS 提供商中进行选择。
and choosing from a number of TTS providers.

184
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:05,100
而且还会涉及更多分支，对吧？
And there are more branches that come in, right?

185
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:08,699
具体来说是两个分支：Telephony Bridge，
Specifically two branches, the Telephony Bridge,

186
00:11:08,699 --> 00:11:12,340
这需要你处理电话技术栈。
which will require you handling the telephony stack.

187
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:17,585
因此要与 Twilio 等服务商合作，处理 SIP 协议、处理 DTMF，
So working with providers like Twilio, handling the SIP protocol, handling DTMF,

188
00:11:17,585 --> 00:11:20,152
分别处理呼入和呼出，
handling inbound and outbound separately,

189
00:11:20,152 --> 00:11:23,481
所有这些都位于 capture 之上，并包裹着所有内容，
And all of that sits above capture and wrapping all of it,

190
00:11:23,481 --> 00:11:28,405
而横跨这个架构中不同组件的是授权，
which cuts across the different components in this architecture is authorization,

191
00:11:28,405 --> 00:11:30,000
会话状态管理。
session state management.

192
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:35,747
处理重连、故障转移、延迟预算、并发和可观测性，
Handling reconnections, failovers, latency budgets, concurrency, observability,

193
00:11:35,747 --> 00:11:38,800
而这些就构成了你在生产环境中的完整技术栈。
and that makes up your entire stack in production.

