235
00:14:11,250 --> 00:14:13,864
级联式技术栈和实时技术栈之间的区别
The difference between cascaded and real time stacks

236
00:14:13,864 --> 00:14:16,420
以及语音在联络中心之外的应用场景。
where voice is showing up beyond the contact center.

237
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:18,820
这一课是我们开始构建的地方。
This lesson is where we start building.

