00:14:19,260 --> 00:14:23,038
所以我们将在第 2 课中感受的是：当语音不再独立存在时会有什么变化。
So what we're going to develop a feel for in lesson 2 is what changes

239
00:14:23,038 --> 00:14:27,915
当语音真正存在于应用程序中时。
when voice doesn't live by itself, when voice actually lives inside an application,

240
00:14:27,915 --> 00:14:31,624
独立语音智能体，那种只会听和说的智能体。
the standalone voice agent, the one that just listens and talks,

241
00:14:31,624 --> 00:14:32,860
这是简单情况。
that's the easy case.

242
00:14:33,660 --> 00:14:37,633
难的情况，也是你们大多数人真正想发布的，是语音
The hard case and the one most of you actually want to ship is voice

243
00:14:37,633 --> 00:14:41,680
它存在于产品、仪表盘、游戏、结账流程内部。
that lives inside a product, a dashboard, a game, a checkout flow.

244
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:44,138
一旦语音进入产品内部，
The moment voice is inside a product,

245
00:14:44,138 --> 00:14:48,432
智能体和 UI 就必须在整个交互过程中保持同步，
the agent and the UI have to stay in lockstep for the entire interaction,

246
00:14:48,432 --> 00:14:49,720
而不只是在开始时。
not just at the start.

247
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,944
有三件事在持续发生：用户说话，
Three things are happening constantly. The user speaks,

248
00:14:52,944 --> 00:14:55,520
UI 必须更新以反映用户请求的内容。
the UI has to update to reflect what they asked for.

249
00:14:55,680 --> 00:15:00,155
用户点击某个东西，智能体必须知道对话过程中发生了什么，
The user clicks something, the agent has to know what happened mid conversation,

250
00:15:00,155 --> 00:15:01,800
任意一侧的状态发生变化。
state changes on either side.

251
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:04,920
另一侧需要立刻知道，而不是等到下一轮。
The other side needs to know now, not on the next turn.

252
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:08,354
如果这三个循环不够快、也不是双向的，
If those three loops aren't fast and bidirectional,

253
00:15:08,354 --> 00:15:11,960
语音和 UI 就会逐渐脱节，体验也会随之崩溃。
voice and UI drift apart and the experience falls apart as well.

254
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:14,720
所以这一整课就是关于如何构建这个通道。
So this whole lesson is about how to build that channel.

255
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:18,320
我们用来解决这个问题的模式，我们称之为 client actions。
The pattern we use to solve this, we call it client actions.

256
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:21,960
它只是语音智能体与
It's just a single typed message channel between the voice agent

257
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,880
应用之间在整个会话期间保持打开的一个类型化消息通道。
and the app open for the whole session.

258
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:29,673
任何一方都可以发送，任何一方都可以立即响应。在智能体到应用的方向上，
Either side can send, either side reacts immediately in the agent to app direction,

259
00:15:29,673 --> 00:15:31,932
有像 render widget 这样的消息，
you have things like render widget,

260
00:15:31,932 --> 00:15:35,472
告诉 UI 显示或更改某些内容，并更新状态，
tell the UI to show or change something and update state,

261
00:15:35,472 --> 00:15:40,067
后者会把智能体侧状态推送到应用。在应用到智能体的方向上，
which pushes agent side state into the app, in the app to agent direction,

262
00:15:40,067 --> 00:15:44,963
有 user event，用户点击、输入、拖拽了某个东西，以及 app state。
you have user event, user clicked, typed, dragged something, and app state,

263
00:15:44,963 --> 00:15:46,620
也就是 UI 当前的
which is the UI's current.

264
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:50,100
状态，会作为上下文发送回来。现在，这里有一个重要细节。
State sent back as context. Now, here's the important detail.

265
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:55,180
两个方向都走音频所用的同一个 WebRTC 数据通道。
Both directions ride the same WebRTC data channel that the audio rides on.

266
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:58,740
所以智能体和应用把彼此视为一个系统，
So the agent and the app see each other as one system,

267
00:15:58,740 --> 00:16:02,140
而不是两个试图通过 HTTP 互相传话的服务。
not as two services trying to gossip through HTTP.

268
