00:25:15,990 --> 00:25:17,550
这就是我所说的“三明治”。
This is what I call the sandwich.

420
00:25:17,910 --> 00:25:21,830
前面是语音转文字，中间是你的智能体，后面是文字转语音。
Speech-to-text in front, your agent in the middle, text-to-speech at the back.

421
00:25:22,310 --> 00:25:25,550
看似简单，直到你意识到刚刚交给智能体的是什么。
Looks simple until you realize what just got handed to your agent.

422
00:25:25,830 --> 00:25:30,182
现在你的智能体要负责对话流程、话轮转换，还要处理 margin，
Now your agent owns the dialogue flow, it owns turn taking, it owns margin,

423
00:25:30,182 --> 00:25:33,060
还要负责副语言信息，但语音转文字这一层除外。
it owns paralinguistics, except speech to text.

424
00:25:33,180 --> 00:25:36,071
语音转文字已经把所有语气、音调、犹豫，
Already threw all the tone, the pitch, the hesitation,

425
00:25:36,071 --> 00:25:38,900
