the emotion away before your agent even saw the input.

426
00:25:39,060 --> 00:25:40,620
这背后还有实际成本。
And there are real costs underneath.

427
00:25:41,220 --> 00:25:46,205
每一轮都要依次付出“语音转文字 + LLM + 文字转语音”的成本。
Every turn pays speech to text plus LLM plus text to speech sequentially.

428
00:25:46,205 --> 00:25:47,580
所以延迟会上升。
So latency goes up.

429
00:25:47,700 --> 00:25:51,660
你的智能体不得不处理对话工作；它本来不是为 back channels（反馈信号）而构建的。
Your agent has to do dialogue work. It wasn't built for back channels.

