00:25:54,670 --> 00:25:57,176
你完全失去了副语言信号，
You lose paralinguistic signal entirely,

432
00:25:57,176 --> 00:26:00,031
而用户在沉默中等待，而你的智能体还在运行，
and the user sits in silence while your agent runs

433
00:26:00,031 --> 00:26:03,790
因为技术栈里没有任何东西在维持对话。
because nothing in the stack is keeping the conversation alive.

