它处理所有对话工作：倾听、话轮转换、副语言信息，
It handles all the dialogue work, listening, turn taking, paralinguistics,

439
00:26:19,980 --> 00:26:23,988
以及对话粘合剂；当用户提出实质性问题时，
the conversational glue, and when the user asks something substantial,

